# MCP Tools First

Before using curl, shell scripts, or manual HTTP requests to interact with any external service:

1. Check `/mcps/` for available MCP server tool descriptors
2. Read the tool schema to understand parameters
3. Use `CallMcpTool` to invoke the tool directly

Never manually implement MCP protocol (SSE connections, session management, JSON-RPC handshakes) when Cursor's built-in `CallMcpTool` handles it automatically.
